{"id":"smirit_sya","lemma":"смириться","pos":"verb","rank":1847,"glosses":["to become reconciled","to give in"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5a/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"смирюсь","2s":"смиришься","3s":"смирится","1p":"смиримся","2p":"смиритесь","3p":"смирятся"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"смирись","2p":"смиритесь"}}},"past":{"m":"смирился","p":"смирились","f":"смирилась","n":"смирилось"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"смиряться","examples":[{"text":"Просто смирись с этим.","en":"Just deal with it.","words":[{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null,{"g":"with / from"},null]},{"text":"С этим трудно смириться.","en":"It's a tough pill to swallow.","words":[{"g":"with / from"},null,{"g":"it is difficult, hard"},null]},{"text":"Ты должен смириться со своей ролью.","en":"You must accept your role.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"role, part","l":"роль"}]},{"text":"Том смирился с неизбежным.","en":"Tom accepted the inevitable.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"with / from"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу смириться с тем, что он умер.","en":"I cannot accept the fact that he is dead.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"}]}]}